assert product_unique_elements([1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 1]) == 120
assert product_unique_elements([1, 2, 2, 3, 3, 3]) == 6

## Canonical Elixir names (use verbatim)
- Module: `Solution`
- Function: `product_unique_elements`

